<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Ceval 9-mo net $22.8 million.</title>
<headline>Brazil Ceval 9-mo net $22.8 million.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian food processor Ceval issued the following statement on its nine-month results.</p>
<p>		     9-MO 1996		 9-MO 1995</p>
<p>    net		$22.8 million		 $47 million</p>
<p>    rvs		$2 bln		    N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: Net profit and revenues were provided in U.S. dollars. No per share figures were given.</p>
</text>
